OL,3,GNEWSAChildren to be offered chickenpox
OL,4,Avaccine
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren on the Isle of Man born
OL,7,Fbetween January 2020 and August 2022
OL,8,Fwill be offered the chickenpox vaccine.
OL,10,FIt is part of the island's catch-up
OL,11,Fprogramme which is designed to help
OL,12,Fprotect against the contagious diease.
OL,14,FThe vaccine protects against measles,
OL,15,Fmumps, rubella and varicella (commonly
OL,16,Fknown as chickenpox).
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
