OL,3,GNEWSAChildren to be offered chickenpox
OL,4,Avaccine
OL,5,
OL,6,FManx Care's Executive Director of
OL,7,FNursing and Allied Health
OL,8,FProfessionals, Sheila Lloyd, said the
OL,9,Fprogramme was "a simple and effective"
OL,10,Fway to provide protection for those
OL,11,Fchildren who may not already be immune.
